      "message": "So mdcache_alloc_and_check_handle only needs content lock if dirent caching is on. In one place, from mdc_lookup_uncached, the caller must hold the lock for other reasons. All other callers take the lock only around the call to mdcache_alloc_and_check_handle. Let\u0027s add a bool param to that function indicating if the lock is held. Then when calling mdcache_dirent_add, if the lock is not held, take it and release it. Coding will be simpler and we can remove all the wrapper locks benefiting other paths also.",
